node_modules
dist
dist-ssr
coverage
*.local
.DS_Store
.claude/settings.local.json

# Agent worktrees. Ephemeral checkouts, never committed — and ignoring them
# keeps a search from the repo root out of stale copies of src/.
.claude/worktrees/

# Env files, defensively. There is deliberately no env-var path for the
# scene-partner API key — Vite inlines env vars into the bundle, so a key in
# .env would be published with the site, and local development uses the same
# Casa screen a phone does. Nothing here should exist; if one ever does, it
# must not be committable. (scripts/check-no-secrets.mjs is the other half:
# it fails the build on a key shape in dist/ or in a tracked file.)
.env*

# Playwright's own output: the HTML report, traces, videos and the blob
# reports a sharded run merges. All regenerated by `npm run e2e`, none of it
# reviewable, and the videos alone would put megabytes of webm in the history.
test-results/
playwright-report/
blob-report/
